				<li>Chandramohan, P., Anu, A. P., Vaigaiarasi, V., &amp; Dharmalingam, K. (2017). Environmental management and emergency preparedness plan for Tsunami disaster along Indian coast. The International Journal of Ocean and Climate Systems, 8(3), 144-152. doi:10.1177/1759313117708253. Summary: Emergency preparedness plan and disaster management plan in natural disasters. Figure 4 shows a conceptual layout of an Emergency Tsunami Rescue Shelter. Keywords: Building Code</li>
				<li>Odisha Tsunami Cyclone shelter images. Summary: Identifies possible tsunami vertical evacuation shelters. Keyword: Response</li>
			</ul>
